    "text": "من صدى حدثنا الوطني \n#spelling_bee_competition\nThe Spelling Bee competition was an outstanding triumph and a truly golden experience that filled our hearts with joy. It was an absolute delight and honor to collaborate with the distinguished board of examiners, including the remarkable Professor Mami and the inspiring Ms. Elizabeth from the United States. We extend our deepest, most heartfelt gratitude to the organizers for their unwavering passion and extraordinary dedication in bringing this memorable event to life... we are eternally thankful❤️❤️\nنشكر شكرًا جزيلًا جمعية جيل التكنولوجيا سطيف وInsaf Association Setifعلى جهودكم الجبارة التي ساهمت في إنجاح هذه المسابقة الرائعة.\nلقد كنتم فعلاً رائعين، فخر الجزائر ❤️❤️ فشكرًا لكم من أعماق القلوب!",
